        "total_days": 10,
        "general_summary": "Embark on a luxurious 10-day family adventure in Santorini, immersing yourselves in the island's breathtaking volcanic landscapes, pristine beaches, and fascinating ancient history. This relaxed-paced journey balances exploration of Minoan ruins and charming villages with ample time for seaside enjoyment, creating unforgettable memories for all.",
